## Footnotes
- GRACE/GRACE-FO anomalies for harmonic solutions are calculated in reference to the 2003--2010 mean and are smoothed using a 350km radius Gaussian filter [@Wahr:1998hy] after destriping with a decorrelation algorithm [@Swenson:2006hu]. 
GSFC GRACE/GRACE-FO mascon data products are calculated as described in @Loomis:2019ef. 
GRACE/GRACE-FO fields have been corrected for Glacial Isostatic Adjustment (GIA) using coefficients from ICE6G Version-D [@Peltier:2018dp].
